The JSON files under research/ contain derived research aggregates plus
factual market identifiers and numeric quote/volume data captured from
the public Kalshi API. The raw API captures (full liquidity-program and
market-metadata dumps, including Kalshi-authored rules text) were removed
before the public release; what remains of Kalshi-originated data is
included for research reproducibility only and is NOT covered by this
project's Apache-2.0 license grant.
